# Normalise on checkin, LF everywhere on checkout.
#
# The site is served as static files straight from the build output, so a stray
# CR in a CSS or JS file is served to the browser as-is. It usually survives
# fine, but it can silently break a strict JSON parse or a shebang.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary